#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:13
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:14
msgid ""
"HeartMuLa is a family of open-source music foundation models (Apache-2.0)"
" that generates music conditioned on lyrics and tags. Comparable to Suno "
"for open-source. Includes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:15
msgid ""
"**HeartMuLa** - Music language model (3B/7B) for generation from lyrics +"
" tags"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:16
msgid "**HeartCodec** - 12.5Hz music codec for high-fidelity audio reconstruction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:17
msgid "**HeartTranscriptor** - Whisper-based lyrics transcription"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:18
msgid "**HeartCLAP** - Audio-text alignment model"
msgstr ""

