#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:60
msgid "4. Patch Source Code (Required for transformers 5.x)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:62
msgid ""
"**Patch 1 - RoPE cache fix** in "
"`src/heartlib/heartmula/modeling_heartmula.py`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:64
msgid ""
"In the `setup_caches` method of the `HeartMuLa` class, add RoPE "
"reinitialization after the `reset_caches` try/except block and before the"
" `with device:` block:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:75
msgid ""
"**Why**: `from_pretrained` creates model on meta device first; "
"`Llama3ScaledRoPE.rope_init()` skips cache building on meta tensors, then"
" never rebuilds after weights are loaded to real device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:77
msgid ""
"**Patch 2 - HeartCodec loading fix** in "
"`src/heartlib/pipelines/music_generation.py`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:79
msgid ""
"Add `ignore_mismatched_sizes=True` to ALL `HeartCodec.from_pretrained()` "
"calls (there are 2: the eager load in `__init__` and the lazy load in the"
" `codec` property)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/heartmula_SKILL.md:81
msgid ""
"**Why**: VQ codebook `initted` buffers have shape `[1]` in checkpoint vs "
"`[]` in model. Same data, just scalar vs 0-d tensor. Safe to ignore."
msgstr ""

